<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12833"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, April 12, 2005 - 5:31 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Oh BTW - The mayor was not re-elected this term. Maybe, the new mayor &#40;Female&#41; will do something to enforce the sexual harassment policies, and give everyone trying to fill DTDC&#39;s job a psych exam!  <BR> <BR>Itty - your right! You really can&#39;t exclude any possibilty with dogface. I don&#39;t remember all of the circumstances around the suicide, but I know people speculated that because his Dad was Chief of Police he lived with all the added pressures from his Dad&#39;s position. I&#39;m reminded of him everytime I go to see my mom because he is buried close to her.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
