<!--Post: 12839--><!--Time: 1113365437-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12839"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tulip<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tulip<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, April 12, 2005 - 9:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Rocky, <BR> <BR>I agree with you that Capps family connection to LE may have been his motivation. He loved to toy with the police.  What better way than to harrass the daughter/sister of a police officer.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12839-->
<!--Post: 13465--><!--Time: 1115345296-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13465"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, May 05, 2005 - 7:08 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Did anybody else watch Ms. Capps interview on Fox News last night? Wow, the crap the devil subjected her to! Ms. Capps mentioned that every time there was going to be local news coverage on BTK he was excited to call it a day and leave work at 5:00 p.m. And the only time he was in a good mood was when he was talking about BTK or a family member. She said otherwise she would have to sneak out the front door. She also said that the devil told her that he never ever made mistakes. And when she called him on making the same mistakes that she did, she would have hell to pay for it. That&#39;s probably why he started poisoning her. I hope she gets her justice too!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
